c21b3ec5-e4b0-49ac-8aab-0f8562eb4927	5584ed28-86c4-4061-b1a4-a751ac0320e0	Sam Houghton	5	Solid all-round e-bike	Great on trails and tarmac. It's one of the more affordable options out there but you'd never know it from the quality. Really easy to put together too — clear instructions and everything you need is in the box.	t	2026-03-28 00:00:00
52e40fdb-b7e5-4183-8a1b-c6506b23ce43	5584ed28-86c4-4061-b1a4-a751ac0320e0	Bethany Cross	5	Surprised at the quality for the price	Assembled it in the garden in about 45 minutes. Everything went together perfectly. The finish and components feel premium — hard to believe this sits at the price point it does.	t	2026-03-20 00:00:00
5c54beee-11b1-45e9-8357-1bac55b07a29	5584ed28-86c4-4061-b1a4-a751ac0320e0	Jordan Whitfield	5	Best budget e-bike I've come across	Budget price, premium quality — that's the best way I can describe it. First ride was great. Motor is smooth, gears shift well, and it looks fantastic. Assembly took me about 35 minutes.	t	2026-03-14 00:00:00
b0992135-7161-4837-8758-a1b4dc2a6761	5584ed28-86c4-4061-b1a4-a751ac0320e0	Priya Mehta	5	Easy assembly, impressive quality	Assembled it indoors the evening it arrived. Really simple process — maybe 30-40 minutes. The quality for the price is honestly remarkable. Feels solid and well made.	t	2026-03-07 00:00:00
90123e5e-0c1e-423d-93ce-c8c528836444	5584ed28-86c4-4061-b1a4-a751ac0320e0	Connor Rafferty	5	Cheap price, not cheap quality	Don't let the price put you off — this is a seriously well built bike. Rides as well as some e-bikes I've tested at double the cost. Straightforward to assemble, clear manual and all tools included.	t	2026-02-26 00:00:00
95d83482-82f7-4424-bafd-fb44cb0e7353	5584ed28-86c4-4061-b1a4-a751ac0320e0	Alicia Drummond	5	Very happy with this purchase	Brilliant bike. You get a lot for your money — the build quality is way above what you'd expect at this price. Putting it together was easy, took about 30 minutes.	t	2026-02-17 00:00:00
